        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>18\" Modern Square Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Contemporary 18 Inch Square Pull makes modern design affordable. Choose from some of the most popular finishes in home decorating: satin nickel, polished chrome, or oil rubbed bronze. This modern door handle is available with your choice of mounting hardware; you can select either thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Just make sure that if you choose back-to-back mounting, you order 2 pulls. This 18 inch center to center pull has a sleek look perfect for any home or office.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-710-ecb.jpg?v=1704354568\" width=\"483\" height=\"105\" border=\"0\" alt=\"18 Inch Square Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n <a href=\"/products/6-3-4-inch-square-handle\"><b>6\" Square Pull</b></a>, \r\n <a href=\"/products/8-3-4-inch-square-handle\"><b>8\" Square Pull</b></a>, and\r\n <a href=\"/products/24-inch-square-door-pull-sgs-sq2475\"><b>24\" Square Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Square 18\" Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Length: 18\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/4\" Square Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls. When ordering Thru-Bolted Mounting for Glass, order (2) <a href=\"/products/sleek-screw-cover-deltana-scf100\">Screw Covers</a></i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Contemporary 18 Inch Square Pull, SGS SQ1875",
                "description": "SGS SQ1875, Contemporary 18 Inch Square Pull - The Contemporary 18 Inch Square Pull makes modern design affordable. Choose from some of the most popular finishes in home decorating: satin nickel, polished chrome, or oil rubbed bronze. This modern door handle is available with your choice of mounting hardware; you can select either thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Just make sure that if you choose back-to-back mounting, you order 2 pulls. This 18 inch center to center pull has a sleek look perfect for any home or office.",
